{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a magical adventure in <strong>\u00d6rn\u00f6ga</strong>! Master powerful spells, collect epic loot, and uncover ancient secrets as you grow from a novice mage to an archwizard. Upgrade your abilities, automate your spellcasting, and watch your power grow\u2014even while you're away.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up and earn Stat Points</strong> to distribute across seven unique Stats, customizing your build to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up spells from four distinct elements</strong>, mastering their power to enhance your abilities in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect epic loot</strong> that that manipulates your spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hire powerful mercenaries</strong> to assist you in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Select a Character</strong> to gain unique abilities and special perks for your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536530/extras/TP9rQj.gif?t=1743172247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00d6rn\u00f6ga</strong> is an idle game where your character fights and explores on their own, requiring no manual input. However, if you prefer a more hands-on approach, you can take control by using character-specific skills and controlling your hero. While playing actively isn\u2019t necessary, it can give you an edge in tough battles and speed up your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536530/extras/57CI3g.gif?t=1743172247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap